# teach skill — per-user learning data must never be committed or shipped.
# Real workspaces live under ${XDG_DATA_HOME:-$HOME/.local/share}/teach/<topic>/.
# These patterns guard against data accidentally landing in the skill folder
# (only the SKILL.md and *-FORMAT.md templates belong there).
skills/teach/MISSION.md
skills/teach/NOTES.md
skills/teach/RESOURCES.md
skills/teach/learning-records/
skills/teach/lessons/
skills/teach/reference/
